    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to Build Your Own E-Commerce Empire?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top Sellers</strong> offers an in-depth business simulation that invites you into the heart of the real-world e-commerce experience. Starting from scratch, you\u2019ll fight to transform your small business into a massive brand using strategic moves and creative solutions. Critical decisions\u2014like product selection, inventory management, customer satisfaction, and expanding into global markets\u2014will shape your business every step of the way. The road to success is tough, but reaching the top is worth it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>What Awaits You in Top Sellers?</strong><br>\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Warehouse Management</strong> \u2013 Control your inventory, expand your space, and prepare orders quickly!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/93a1fd41657513a52ccf737e5472b948.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/93a1fd41657513a52ccf737e5472b948.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/93a1fd41657513a52ccf737e5472b948.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Wholesale Stores</strong> \u2013 Seize profitable opportunities and shape your store\u2019s direction!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d44b56a143dc2f7cda0169c7efb4ad00.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d44b56a143dc2f7cda0169c7efb4ad00.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d44b56a143dc2f7cda0169c7efb4ad00.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u26a1 <strong>Fast Delivery &amp; Drone Shipping</strong> \u2013 Deliver orders quickly and boost customer satisfaction!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/5c0f7fc8deb299614099f46bf375530e.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/5c0f7fc8deb299614099f46bf375530e.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/5c0f7fc8deb299614099f46bf375530e.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboard</strong> \u2013 Leave your competitors behind!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d9b99e2c4a8e7d8be0e0ab00aa8c3466.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d9b99e2c4a8e7d8be0e0ab00aa8c3466.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/d9b99e2c4a8e7d8be0e0ab00aa8c3466.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\ude9a\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Local to Global Trade &amp; Logistics</strong> \u2013 Prove your strength in the local market, break boundaries, fulfill international orders, and become the Big Boss on the global stage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/acea7d40700f51b3ae5612adec7fa754.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/acea7d40700f51b3ae5612adec7fa754.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/acea7d40700f51b3ae5612adec7fa754.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Second-Hand Market</strong> \u2013 Buy cheap, sell high! Bargain and gain the advantage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/3d03920dbd72e048dd725d99c9724208.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/3d03920dbd72e048dd725d99c9724208.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/3d03920dbd72e048dd725d99c9724208.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>New Employees</strong> \u2013 Grow your business and build a strong team!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/383ccefc960fc4434638b3767eac4973.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/383ccefc960fc4434638b3767eac4973.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/383ccefc960fc4434638b3767eac4973.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Finance Management - Banking &amp; Loans</strong> \u2013 Track tax and rent processes! Manage your finances wisely and accelerate your growth!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/588253be43475d77d43787885a62024d.poster.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/588253be43475d77d43787885a62024d.webm?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/588253be43475d77d43787885a62024d.mp4?t=1750773617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Steam Deck Support</strong> \u2013 Play anywhere!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310510/extras/bf9288459c5a4ef7a9fbb25dfde95d1a.avif?t=1750773617\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROGRESS &amp; GROWTH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy is your game! Access a wider product range from wholesalers and expand your product selection. Grow your warehouse to stock more products and maintain the order flow. Remember, more orders mean more income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your business grows, hire new employees to strengthen your team. Use technology and boost your speed with drone delivery! Offer excellent service to increase your store rating. As your rating rises, you'll receive more orders and climb the <strong>Top Sellers</strong> leaderboard. Collect badges and advance on your journey to becoming the king of e-commerce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Features Coming Soon!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a richer experience in <strong>Top Sellers</strong>! In addition to the features you\u2019ve enjoyed so far, look forward to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Antiques from the Train</strong> \u2013 Earn high profits with unique and rare items! \ud83d\udee4\ufe0f<br>\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>Special Day Campaigns</strong> \u2013 Increase your sales with seasonal opportunities!<br>\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f <strong>Seasonal Products</strong> \u2013 Be ready for every season with summer and winter stock!<br>\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f <strong>Fast Delivery with GPS Tracking</strong> \u2013 Track deliveries in real-time and increase your speed!<br>\ud83c\udfe0 <strong>Home Buying &amp; Decoration</strong> \u2013 Use your earnings to create your own living space!<br>\ud83d\udcca <strong>Detailed Statistics</strong> \u2013 Analyze data to improve your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to reach the top of the trade world?  Let\u2019s get started!\u00a0\ud83d\udd25</strong></p>",
